## Phase 4 — Verify and sustain

### Era 13 — Verification & Sustaining Process (V44–V47) — ✅ done, verified 2026-09-17

`mint broken-links`; the verified-vs-reviewed audit of every example; the CLI-change →
docs-review gate; the recurring inventory-refresh cadence so this gap does not reopen.

